---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Crayonweb Digital Services | Website Audits, UX/UI, Development & Mobile Apps";
const description = "Comprehensive digital services tailored to your business growth.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/services/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>Comprehensive Digital Services Tailored to Your Business Growth</h1>
    <p>Crayonweb is a creative digital agency that transforms ideas into visually compelling stories. We specialize in TYPO3 development, TYPO3 support, and ongoing website maintenance to ensure your business stays fast, secure, and scalable. Our services include responsive web design, custom TYPO3 extensions, branding, and digital marketing solutions, all designed to deliver seamless user experiences and measurable growth. With a focus on creativity and technology, CrayonWeb helps businesses build powerful online presence and achieve long-term success.</p>
    <p>Brand Design, UI/UX Design, Mockup Design, Multimedia Service, SEO Service, Web Development, Mobile App, Web Application, ERP Solution</p>
    <p>Brand Design, UI/UX Design, Mockup Design, Multimedia Service, SEO Service, Web Development, Mobile App, Web Application, ERP Solution</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:2rem;margin-top:2rem">
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/branding-design/">Web Design</a></h2><p>Web design trends: User-Centric Web Design that Drives Engagement and Conversions</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/web-development/">Web Development</a></h2><p>we specialize in delivering innovative web solutions tailored to your business needs.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/branding-and-identity/">Branding & Identity Design</a></h2><p>Make Your Brand Memorable - We create logos, brand identities, and visuals that reflect your vision and resonate with your audience.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/smart-growth-marketing/">Digital Marketing & SEO</a></h2><p>Boost Your Online Visibility - Improve rankings, attract traffic, and grow your brand with targeted SEO and digital marketing campaigns.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/cms-solution/">CMS Solution</a></h2><p>Smart, scalable CMS solutions that make managing your website simple and hassle-free.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/mobile-application/">Mobile Application</a></h2><p>We design and develop custom mobile apps that deliver seamless user experiences and drive business growth.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/media-creation-services/">Creative Visual Production</a></h2><p>Professional product photography and expert video editing to create high-quality visuals that showcase your brand at its best.</p></article>
      <article><h2 style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="/service/ai-powered-business-solutions/">AI-Powered Business Solutions</a></h2><p>We build custom AI agents and automated workflows using tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and n8n to streamline tasks and boost productivity.</p></article>
    </div>
    <h2>Simplify your work and get more done!</h2>
    <p>Our powerful features and flexible options streamline your workflow effortlessly. Transform the way you work with our smart, flexible tools and exclusive features. Make every task faster, simpler, and more efficient, streamline your workflow, and boost productivity, all while focusing on what truly matters for your business growth.</p>
    <h2>Special Services by Crayonweb</h2>
    <p>Driving Digital Growth with Smart Solutions</p>
    <ul>
      <li>TYPO3 CMS</li>
      <li>Node JS</li>
      <li>Next JS</li>
      <li>Wordpress</li>
      <li>Flutter</li>
      <li>React Native</li>
      <li>Magento</li>
      <li>Shopify</li>
      <li>ERPnext</li>
      <li>Storyblok Headless CMS</li>
      <li>Strapi Headless CMS</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What Client Says?</h2>
    <p>Testimonials are shown on the home page, with the same 7 client testimonials as live.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
